## 0. Frontend movement since last audit (web, last ~30 days)

These are **web** changes. Mobile should copy **API contracts and filters**, not the DOM/RQ UI.

### 2026-08-11 — homepage / booking chrome
- Homepage sections restyled; marketing copy moved to `/about-cholobd`
- Hero booking widget and booking pages refined
- Hotel booking URL bug fixed
- Web mobile-width menus / navbar / notifications polished
- Deploy-blocking bugfix

### 2026-08-27 — tour builder + paginated lists + transport
- **Tour builder split:** catalog (`/tour-builder` + `/tour-builder/platform`) vs personal (`/tour-builder/my` + `/tour-builder/custom`)
- Catalog/personal CRUD, image delete, richer day-segment payload (`shortDescription`, `segmentOrder`, `hotelId`, `transportId`, `notes`)
- Shared `unwrapPaginatedList`: list `data` is now `{ results, total, page, limit }` (not a bare array)
- Applied on: hotels, tour spots, activity spots, guides, tour builder, transports
- Admin/asset list pages: pagination + division / name / budget filters
- **New web APIs (not on mobile yet):** `transportApi`, `transportInventoryApi`, `transportBookingApi`
- Bus service-admin UI (management / rides / tickets)
- Transport CRUD pages (`/transports`)

### 2026-08-27 + follow-up — homepage tours
- `GuideSuggestions` typed against unwrapped `Guide[]` (not `.results` on an array)
- `TourSuggestions` fetches via `useGetAllTourPlansRQ` (client), not Server Component `getAllTourPlans`
- `getAllTourPlans` uses `cache: "no-store"` so production `/` cannot bake a stale list shape

### Frontend API barrel (`services/api/index.ts`) now exports
Previously missing from the barrel, now present: `GuideBookingApi`, `TransportApi`, `TransportInventoryApi`, `TransportBookingApi`.  
Still not in the web barrel: trip planner, package bookings (mobile remains ahead there).

---

## 1. Verdict

Mobile still covers the **core traveler loop**: auth, locations, hotels + hotel booking, tour spots, **catalog** tour builder + package booking, trip planner, community, payments (SSL init), hotel service-admin (profile, current bookings, QR), and **guides / guide booking** (browse, request, pay, operator actions).

Largest remaining gaps vs current frontend: **personal tour packages** — full infrastructure (types/API/hooks/screens/forms) added 2026-08-30; **activity-spot booking** — API/types/hooks added 2026-08-30, **no booking UI/screens yet**; **transport** stack — types/API/hooks + dashboard shells added 2026-08-30, **detailed inventory/booking/operations UI not yet ported from frontend**; **reviews CRUD**, **bookmarks**, **notifications**, **complaints**, **wallet**, **addresses**, **search**, **categories/config**; **activity/hotel employee modules**; **master-admin modules**.

